{
  "course": "初中60短文",
  "passage": 51,
  "title": "Passage 51",
  "voice": "温暖自然英式女老师｜IndexTTS2.5 慢速教学",
  "sentences": [
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 1,
      "sourceSentenceId": 1,
      "chunkId": "s51-p01",
      "image": "assets/images/01.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s51-p01.mp3",
      "en": "A zero-waste life is a lifestyle that hardly creates any rubbish.",
      "cn": "零浪费生活是一种几乎不产生任何垃圾的生活方式。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 2,
      "sourceSentenceId": 2,
      "chunkId": "s51-p02",
      "image": "assets/images/02.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s51-p02.mp3",
      "en": "Zero waste was first suggested by a French woman called B. Johnson.",
      "cn": "零浪费最初是由一位名叫碧·约翰逊的法国女士提出的。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 3,
      "sourceSentenceId": 3,
      "chunkId": "s51-p03",
      "image": "assets/images/03.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s51-p03.mp3",
      "en": "Her idea is to live a life and try not to create any rubbish.",
      "cn": "她的理念是：过一种尽量不产生任何垃圾的生活。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 4,
      "sourceSentenceId": 4,
      "chunkId": "s51-p04-01",
      "image": "assets/images/04.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s51-p04-01.mp3",
      "en": "Use different kinds of ways to save the environment,",
      "cn": "用各种方式来保护环境，"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 5,
      "sourceSentenceId": 4,
      "chunkId": "s51-p04-02",
      "image": "assets/images/04.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s51-p04-02.mp3",
      "en": "such as stopping the use of one-off objects,",
      "cn": "如停止使用一次性物品，"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 6,
      "sourceSentenceId": 4,
      "chunkId": "s51-p04-03",
      "image": "assets/images/04.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s51-p04-03.mp3",
      "en": "giving unwanted things to others or donating these things to organisations like the Red Cross.",
      "cn": "将不需要的东西送给他人或捐给红十字会等组织。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 7,
      "sourceSentenceId": 5,
      "chunkId": "s51-p05",
      "image": "assets/images/05.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s51-p05.mp3",
      "en": "A zero-waste life follows the 6R rule—Refuse, Reduce, Reuse, Repair, Recycle and Rot.",
      "cn": "零浪费生活遵循“6R”原则——Refuse（拒绝）、Reduce（减少）、Reuse（再利用）、Repair（修理）、Recycle（回收）和Rot（堆肥降解）。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 8,
      "sourceSentenceId": 6,
      "chunkId": "s51-p06",
      "image": "assets/images/06.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s51-p06.mp3",
      "en": "Chen Yuan, 27, is deeply interested in this idea.",
      "cn": "27岁的陈媛对这个理念非常感兴趣。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 9,
      "sourceSentenceId": 7,
      "chunkId": "s51-p07",
      "image": "assets/images/07.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s51-p07.mp3",
      "en": "She and her boyfriend Joe have lived in Beijing for many years.",
      "cn": "她和男友乔已经在北京生活了很多年。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 10,
      "sourceSentenceId": 8,
      "chunkId": "s51-p08-01",
      "image": "assets/images/08.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s51-p08-01.mp3",
      "en": "Over August-October when Chen followed the rule of zero waste 6R,",
      "cn": "在8月至10月期间，陈媛遵循零浪费“6R”原则，"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 11,
      "sourceSentenceId": 8,
      "chunkId": "s51-p08-02",
      "image": "assets/images/08.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s51-p08-02.mp3",
      "en": "she and her boyfriend both produced only two cans of rubbish.",
      "cn": "她和男友两个人只产生了两罐垃圾。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 12,
      "sourceSentenceId": 9,
      "chunkId": "s51-p09-01",
      "image": "assets/images/09.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s51-p09-01.mp3",
      "en": "Now the couple have opened a small shop in Beijing,",
      "cn": "现在，这对情侣在北京开了一家小店，"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 13,
      "sourceSentenceId": 9,
      "chunkId": "s51-p09-02",
      "image": "assets/images/09.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s51-p09-02.mp3",
      "en": "where they use wood products to take the place of plastic ones and cloth bags printed with environmental logos.",
      "cn": "店里用木制品代替塑料制品，还使用印有环保标志的布袋。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 14,
      "sourceSentenceId": 10,
      "chunkId": "s51-p10",
      "image": "assets/images/10.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s51-p10.mp3",
      "en": "The store also has second-hand books and CDs to make the best of the used things.",
      "cn": "店里还有二手书和光盘，以充分利用已使用过的物品。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 15,
      "sourceSentenceId": 11,
      "chunkId": "s51-p11",
      "image": "assets/images/11.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s51-p11.mp3",
      "en": "The zero-waste lifestyle is not for ascetics. It is just around us.",
      "cn": "零浪费的生活方式并不是给苦行僧们准备的。它其实就在我们身边。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 16,
      "sourceSentenceId": 12,
      "chunkId": "s51-p12",
      "image": "assets/images/12.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s51-p12.mp3",
      "en": "Chen is devoting herself to the zero-waste lifestyle.",
      "cn": "陈媛自己正致力于零浪费的生活方式。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 17,
      "sourceSentenceId": 13,
      "chunkId": "s51-p13",
      "image": "assets/images/13.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s51-p13.mp3",
      "en": "She expects some of her friends to join her on the road to zero waste.",
      "cn": "她希望她的一些朋友们也能加入她的零浪费之路。"
    }
  ],
